Description: replace the removed private brightness helper
 The legacy tree's BPrivate::perceptual_brightness() does not exist in
 the V\OS private interface headers, so the call cannot compile. Use an
 equivalent fixed-point BT.601 luminance computation inline; it only
 picks the stroke/text color for the workspace number on the desktop
 background.
Author: Dario Casalinuovo <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/View.cpp
+++ b/View.cpp
@@ -79,7 +79,10 @@
 	FillEllipse(rect);
 
 	// determine color for stroke / number string
-	int brightness = BPrivate::perceptual_brightness(bgColor);
+	// (fixed-point luminance; the private perceptual helper of the
+	// legacy tree has no counterpart here)
+	int brightness = (38139 * bgColor.red + 30195 * bgColor.green
+		+ 11703 * bgColor.blue) >> 16;
 	if (brightness > 127)
 		SetHighColor(16, 16, 16);
 	else
